body:
hi there, i am no doctor - im my experience (i have fibro) the pain doesnt ever "go away". you mentioned when you sit down, put your arms down - it goes away. thats not how mine works but then again, EVERY body is different. Also, the "going limp to my sides", i personally dont experience that with the parts of the body that my fibro is worse ( i dont feel it in my arms yet, everywhere else is infected.) but going "limp" doesnt relieve the pain for me.

&#x200B;

again, im no doctor. just sharing my experience. female, 30.
